    "title": "The Fence Show & Security Expo",
    "description": "This app is your ultimate guide to The Fence Show 2024 expo! Whether you're a fencing enthusiast or just curious about the latest in fence-related technology and security, this app has everything you need to make the most of your visit.\r\nWith The Fence Show app, you can easily scan and save leads via QR code, navigate the expo floor plan, view exhibitor information, and browse the schedule of events. Plus, there's a QR code scavenger hunt for you to try at the expo!\r\nDownload The Fence Show app today and get ready to experience the best in fence innovation and design!",
